Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:23.27,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Another day with no activity \Nfrom Gekko, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:24.55,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:26.96,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,They've been keeping their heads \Ndown these past two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:29.79,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,But at least we get a little peace and quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:31.97,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:34.06,main,Prof,0,0,0,,You're not allowed to stack draw cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.06,0:00:36.25,top,Misaki,0,0,0,,It's legal where I come from!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:38.06,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes... peace is best.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.25,0:00:38.62,top,Prof,0,0,0,,No, it's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:41.56,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,No one wants to fight if they don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.97,0:00:42.73,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.55,0:00:47.03,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,If I don't fight, I won't \Nbe able to see Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:48.48,sign_24298_247_squee,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(45,55,40,42)\frz25.56\fs15\fad(183,1)}Fudo~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:48.48,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:53.85,sign_1163_15_MUSCLE,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(95,103)\frz5.745\fad(1,589)}MUSCLE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:53.85,sign_1163_15_MUSCLE,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(168,135)\c&H66685C&\3c&HDCA7A1&\frz320.9\fad(1,589)}MUSCLE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:53.85,sign_1163_15_MUSCLE,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs8\c&H66685C&\3c&HDCA7A1&\frz320.9\pos(55,184)\fad(1,589)}Use my weight training \Nregimen to reach the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.53,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I haven't had a proper night's sleep in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:54.74,sign_24298_247_squee,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&H9079ED&\pos(569,42)\frz350.9\bord2\3c&HFDEFFD&\fad(668,1)}Fudo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.53,0:00:52.19,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.19,0:00:53.85,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'm going through serious \NDesumi-san withdrawal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:54.74,sign_24298_247_squee,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&H9079ED&\move(47,135,42,127)\bord2\3c&HFDEFFD&\fad(668,1)\frz19.92}Fudo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.85,0:00:54.74,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:56.95,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I have to do something about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:05.50,italics,Base Announcer,0,0,0,,Signs of new weapon development \Nin Gekko's headquarters detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.97,0:01:10.43,italics,Base Announcer,0,0,0,,I repeat, signs of new weapon development \Nin Gekko's headquarters detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.59,0:01:09.33,top,Prof,0,0,0,,Speak of the devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.19,italics,Base Announcer,0,0,0,,The team is to infiltrate their base
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:15.13,italics,Base Announcer,0,0,0,,and destroy the new weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.49,0:01:17.65,main,Prof,0,0,0,,An infiltration mission, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.65,0:01:20.16,main,Prof,0,0,0,,This isn't going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:22.39,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,That's way too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.39,0:01:24.32,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,It's basically suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:27.17,main,Prof,0,0,0,,But someone has to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.77,0:01:29.61,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Pink and Blue are traveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.61,0:01:32.32,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Green is on paid leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.74,0:01:37.24,main,Prof,0,0,0,,It has to be either you \Nor Fudo-kun, Misaki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:42.87,main,Prof,0,0,0,,And the other needs to remain here, \Njust in case something happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.99,0:01:47.67,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,All right. I'll go—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.57,0:01:49.72,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:50.80,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Fudo-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:53.75,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Hang on! Don't you realize \Nhow dangerous this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.97,0:01:55.07,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I will go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:55.76,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:57.63,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I {\i1}must{\i0} go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.63,0:01:58.63,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.63,0:01:59.87,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Misaki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:02.23,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Try to understand him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:07.81,main,Prof,0,0,0,,He knows... He knows what he's doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:10.34,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Freezing Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.34,0:02:11.36,italics,changer,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:15.61,italics,changer,0,0,0,,Change Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:20.93,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Red Gelato, Fudo Aikawa, departing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:24.66,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:26.75,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,You'd better come back, you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:34.72,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,He really is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:39.26,main,Prof,0,0,0,,He is a true hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.90,0:02:42.15,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,And now I'll get...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:44.90,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,to see Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:23.49,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(324,61)\fscx90\fad(920,1)}Episode 3     {\fscx88}At Last, the Amusement Park
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:24.62,main,Combatant A,0,0,0,,Pay respect to the Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:28.58,main,Combatant B,0,0,0,,Welcome, Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:37.39,main,Combatant B,0,0,0,,Dang, she's in a killer mood today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:40.55,main,Combatant C,0,0,0,,She seems even more murderous than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:42.80,main,Combatant D,0,0,0,,Bet she woke up on the wrong side of the bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.88,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,No, that's not what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:47.77,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm actually in agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.42,0:04:49.47,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:53.55,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,I haven't seen Fudo in two whole weeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:55.14,italics,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz15.95\move(60,13,67,8)\fad(176,1)}Desumi-san
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.55,0:04:54.40,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:56.79,italics,,0,0,0,,Desumi-san... {\fs20}Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:04:58.61,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Excuse me, combatants...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:05:00.26,main,Combatants,0,0,0,,M-Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:04.99,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,When do you think we'll get \Nto fight those heroes again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:06.99,main,Combatants,0,0,0,,She's out for blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.08,0:05:10.68,main,Combatants,0,0,0,,We do not know! Please forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:12.87,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Er, that's okay... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.18,0:05:21.34,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I had a lousy horoscope this morning, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:30.80,sign_7707_80_LEO,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(315,153)\fad(506,387)}L\NE\NO
