Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:30.80,sign_7707_81_You_won_t_see_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(415,198)\bord0\fs11\fsp3.8\fad(506,387)}Lucky Item
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:30.80,sign_7707_81_You_won_t_see_th,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(430,240)\fs28\fad(506,387)\bord3}Pouch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.27,0:05:25.45,flashback italics,voice,0,0,0,,Today's worst horoscope \Ngoes to you, my Leo friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:28.41,sign_7798_85_DOOM___,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(105,20,105,0)\fscy140\fad(210,875)}D\NO\NO\NM\N{\fscy70}.\N.\N.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.91,0:05:27.62,flashback italics,voice,0,0,0,,You won't see the person you're waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:30.89,flashback italics,voice,0,0,0,,Your lucky item is a cute little pouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:36.44,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Guess it didn't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.89,0:05:39.08,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Ah, Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:41.98,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Culverin Bear-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:45.36,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Behold! It's finished at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:49.23,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,My new weapons, the Neo Culverin Cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:54.28,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,I'll use my new power \Nto atomize those heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.93,0:05:59.47,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,That's quite a dangerous \Nthing you've got there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:00.13,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.57,0:06:02.27,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It's just a pouch—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:05.92,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Say no more. I know exactly what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:08.65,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,It holds concealed weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:09.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Well, actually—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.93,0:06:13.39,main,culverin,0,0,0,,And the pouch's design is camouflage \Nto get the enemy's guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:15.99,main,culverin,0,0,0,,You're a terrifying woman, start to finish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:28.20,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just not a good fit for this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:35.11,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fu—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.11,0:06:36.04,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.39,0:06:37.72,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I've been looking everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.72,0:06:38.89,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I've missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.89,0:06:39.79,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:43.88,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I... I'm so happy to see you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:44.96,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:47.44,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:47.55,sign_9769_111_Reaper_Princess_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz-26.08\fax0.41\pos(362,120)}Reaper Princess\N\h\h Dressing Room
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:47.67,sign_9769_111_Reaper_Princess_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz-14.57\fax0.13\pos(335,147)}Reaper Princess\N Dressing Room
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:47.80,sign_9769_111_Reaper_Princess_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz-7.13\fax0.06\pos(325,178)}Reaper Princess\N Dressing Room
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:49.55,sign_9769_111_Reaper_Princess_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(328,210)}Reaper Princess\N Dressing Room
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:51.18,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:53.48,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,So this is your dressing room?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:55.93,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's as girly as I expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.19,0:06:57.91,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What were you thinking, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:06:59.24,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,This is extremely dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:01.64,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I just wanted to see you that badly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:06.36,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Well, I... I wanted to see you, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:08.48,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But this is still way too dangerous—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:09.66,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I know, Desumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:10.91,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You want to play this with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:12.31,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.01,0:07:14.60,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:21.18,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Professor, any word from Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:24.96,main,Prof,0,0,0,,No, nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.39,0:07:27.47,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:31.38,main,Prof,0,0,0,,For now, all we can do is have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:36.43,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,There! I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:38.05,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And now for your punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.05,0:07:39.10,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hold out your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:40.31,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.65,0:07:42.07,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:43.17,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Your hand's so nice and warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:50.82,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't say that! Now I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:52.20,sign_3317_26_The_cuteness,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(90,220)}Oh so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:52.20,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Oh so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.15,0:07:54.19,italics,combatant,0,0,0,,I have a report!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:08:00.91,italics,combatant,0,0,0,,Rea...per Prin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:03.52,italics,combatant,0,0,0,,...cess. It appears there's \Nan intruder in the base!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.52,0:08:05.29,italics,combatant,0,0,0,,We need to be on high alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:06.74,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm aware of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:08.39,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Let's remain cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:09.75,italics,Combatant,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.75,0:08:12.55,italics,Combatant,0,0,0,,I felt sure I saw a man there just—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.79,0:08:14.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Your imagination, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:16.39,italics,Combatant,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:19.98,italics,Combatant,0,0,0,,It's not like {\i0}you'd{\i1} ever be \Nwith a man, Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:21.70,italics,Combatant,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:25.44,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:27.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.57,0:08:30.36,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,I'm coming in, Reaper—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:33.86,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,—Prin...cess...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.28,0:08:35.36,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,There's an intruder—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:39.58,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Oh, she's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:43.26,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,D-Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:44.52,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:47.24,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I accidentally shut myself in with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.24,0:08:48.92,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:50.91,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's kind of a tight fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.91,0:08:53.34,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Stupid! Stop moving around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:57.05,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,And there's something on my face \Nthat's making it hard to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:09:00.06,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I really need to take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.85,0:09:11.77,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I got it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.45,0:09:46.41,italics,Base Announcer,0,0,0,,New weapon signal lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:48.06,italics,Base Announcer,0,0,0,,Damage to Gekko's base confirmed as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:49.92,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Did he do it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:51.82,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Fudo, you're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.64,0:10:02.12,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Sorry to just drop in on \Nyou like that, Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:04.45,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,No, I'm the one who should apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:07.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You came all that way to see me,\N and I was a terrible host.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:10.87,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh... Fudo, there's a cut on your cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.87,0:10:12.78,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Hey, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:15.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Come down here a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:22.97,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,That should do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:25.03,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Thank you, Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:28.19,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Hey, what a cute pouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:29.98,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's perfect for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:36.26,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,And... I wish I'd thought \Nof this earlier, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:39.53,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Here. It's my phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:42.34,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Now we can talk any time we want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:46.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey, Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.66,0:10:50.69,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I call you tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.66,0:10:52.17,sign_10322_110_Bluuush,sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&H1B09C7&\an2\frz-8.13\move(585,105,600,68)\fs19}Bluuush
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:52.17,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Oh so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:52.17,sign_3317_26_The_cuteness,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(90,255)}Oh so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:54.49,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.67,0:11:00.68,sign_3317_26_The_cuteness,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(130,100)\fs18}Secret Society Gekko\NWomen's Dorm
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:07.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,C-Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:08.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:11.64,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You're just calling to make \Nsure he got home safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:15.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A-All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:26.30,main,Fudo's Mother,0,0,0,,Yes? Aikawa residence!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:30.23,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Mom, that call's for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.23,0:11:32.08,italics,Fudo's Mother,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:33.80,italics,Fudo's Mother,0,0,0,,I told you to go out and buy milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.21,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Just give me the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:38.42,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Sorry, Desumi-san. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:38.42,sign_7030_70_Desumi_san,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,1)\move(245,105,249,93)\frz-14.04}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:38.42,top,Fudo's Mother,0,0,0,,Who is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:41.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.73,0:11:44.39,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Please buy a smartphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:46.51,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes, that might be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:51.98,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Love After World Domination!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:04.03,italics,Gekko Announcer,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:06.08,italics,Gekko Announcer,0,0,0,,It's time for the morning meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:09.40,italics,Gekko Announcer,0,0,0,,All executives, please \Ncome to the meeting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:44.50,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Good morning, all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:48.86,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,{\bord3\shad3}I am Supreme Leader Bosslar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:53.87,sign_18427_212_Head_of_Secret_S,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,265)}Head of Secret Society Gekko\N{\fs17}Supreme Leader Bosslar
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.77,0:12:53.30,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,{\bord3\shad3}I believe it's time to begin \Nour regular meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.87,0:12:59.68,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Your brave efforts have allowed us to\Ncollect a steady supply of negative energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:02.65,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Rejoice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.65,0:13:07.60,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,The birth of our monstrous culmination, \NUltimate Phantom, is at hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.59,0:13:09.35,sign_5517_46_Allow_me_to_expl,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur4\an8}Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:09.35,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.61,0:13:13.73,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Secret Society Gekko, \Nled by Supreme Leader Bosslar,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.48,sign_19031_220_Negative,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,436)}Negative
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:17.48,sign_19031_221_Negative_Energy,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz-6.38\pos(535,60)\fad(1,476)}Negative Energy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:17.84,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,uses the negative emotions \Nof humans as a power source,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:19.77,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,to create new monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:24.44,sign_19031_221_Negative_Energy,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz11.98\pos(95,210)\fscx90\fad(295,1)}Ultimate Phantom
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:22.84,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and further its goal of world domination!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:27.93,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,In the interest of collecting the \Nremaining negative energy needed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:30.95,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,I will now take suggestions \Nregarding our next target.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:34.20,sign_19450_229_Beast_Princess,Sign,0,0,0,,Beast Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:34.20,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Yes, Beast Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:36.09,main,beast,0,0,0,,Who the hell cares what our target is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:40.69,sign_19450_229_Beast_Princess,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs19}Beast Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:40.69,sign_18427_212_Head_of_Secret_S,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(120,255)}Gekko Princess Series\N{\fs17}Beast Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.09,0:13:37.79,main,beast,0,0,0,,Just let us fight already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.36,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,But the selection of the target \Nis the purpose of this meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.82,0:13:43.46,main,Steel,0,0,0,,You're as boorish as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:46.04,sign_19450_229_Beast_Princess,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs19\an9}Steel Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:46.04,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Yes, Steel Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:51.03,sign_18427_212_Head_of_Secret_S,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(527,265)\fad(1,784)}Gekko Princess Series\N{\fs17}Steel Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:50.21,top,steel,0,0,0,,I require more time to consider the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.21,0:13:52.26,top,Bosslar,0,0,0,,You didn't need to press the button for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:14:00.52,sign_19450_229_Beast_Princess,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs19}Heat Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:55.19,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Yes, Heat Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:14:00.48,sign_18427_212_Head_of_Secret_S,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(535,265)\fad(1,266)}Gekko Princess Series\N{\fs17} Heat Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:00.52,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Say something already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:01.73,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:04.22,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Doesn't anyone have a real suggestion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:07.11,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Excellent! Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.11,0:14:08.38,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A view of the city lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.11,0:14:09.51,sign_19450_229_Beast_Princess,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs19}Reaper Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:10.03,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,That's far too abstract.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:12.11,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Next—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:14.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,An aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:16.62,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,It's difficult to fight indoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:18.58,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,An amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:21.96,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,What's with you and date destinations?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.13,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Disappointment...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.44,sign_20667_257_Disappoint,sign,0,0,0,,{\move(370,80,375,90)\fad(1,704)}Disappointment...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:25.02,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Wait a moment, Bosslar-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:29.22,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,An amusement park {\i1}would{\i0} be filled \Nwith helpless, unsuspecting humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:31.79,main,Steel,0,0,0,,And we could have our fill, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:36.17,main,Beast,0,0,0,,That's a nasty little brain \Nyou've got, Reaper Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.31,0:14:39.64,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:43.18,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Our next target shall \Nbe... the amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:55.12,sign_21392_264_Smartphones_for_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Smartphones for {\fnVerdana\blur0\c&H33D2DB&\3c&H3842D7&}Dummies!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:55.12,sign_21392_265_Learn_it_all_in_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz8.95\fax-0.06\pos(380,250)\fsp2.6}Learn it all in just 10 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:15:00.50,sign_21392_264_Smartphones_for_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fs15\pos(110,20)}Smartphones for {\fnVerdana\blur0\c&H33D2DB&\3c&H3842D7&}Dummies!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:15:00.50,sign_21392_265_Learn_it_all_in_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(110,40)}Learn it all in just 10 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.81,0:15:01.63,sign_21598_268_You_have_a_new_m,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz-1.13\fax-0.56\pos(325,190)\fad(173,1)}You have a new message
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.16,0:15:06.46,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'm still not used to that sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:09.55,sign_21754_271_Desumi_san,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\frx20\pos(394,72)\frz358.5}Desumi-san
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:09.55,sign_21754_271_Desumi_san,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\frz358.5\pos(390,234)\frx10}Big Gelato
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:09.55,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,It's from Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.30,0:15:16.56,sign_21598_268_You_have_a_new_m,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(205,110)\fs8\fad(1000,1)}Fudo! Rejoice!\N Gekko's next target is that theme park\N we've been wanting to go to, Yomiuriland!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:15.24,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.47,0:15:21.54,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,I don't mind meeting up in old factories\N and quarries and places like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.54,0:15:24.15,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,But I wish we could go to a proper \Ncouples' spot once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.15,0:15:26.88,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,I agree. Like an aquarium!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:29.02,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,Or a place with a view of the city lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.02,0:15:30.82,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,A theme park would be awesome, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:34.12,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,Of course, that's all a distant dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:42.76,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I can't believe that dream of a few \Ndays ago is coming true for us already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:49.55,sign_21598_268_You_have_a_new_m,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(185,80)\fs16}The attack will be Sunday, three days from now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:49.55,sign_22665_283_Can_t_wait_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz0.53\pos(155,155)\fsp3}Can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:51.78,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san leaks her organization's \Ndeepest-held secrets so casually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:53.13,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,That sweet little scatterbrain...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:54.82,sign_24298_247_squee,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(170,450)\fs19\pos(363,20)\c&H000000&}squee
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:56.77,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Okay, I'd better reply!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.00,0:15:59.69,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What? "Swipe"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.86,0:16:02.98,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Look at him fret!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.98,0:16:05.08,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,What in the world is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:07.82,main,Prof,0,0,0,,He apparently got his first \Nsmartphone yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:10.07,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fudo{\i0} got a smartphone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.07,0:16:12.36,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,That bodybuilding gremlin got a smartphone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.72,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:15.66,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Hey, Suri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.45,0:16:23.50,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Um... I... I'll come to the... like \Nto come to... theme thark... Thunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:27.82,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,W-Weather?! Tell me... t-tell \Nweather. To me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:29.66,italics,Suri,0,0,0,,I didn't catch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.43,0:16:32.30,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,Something's going down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.54,0:16:37.92,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,Fudo! Did you think you could hide from \Nthe mistress of meddling, Misaki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.47,0:16:43.10,italics,Misaki,0,0,0,,I can't wait until Sunday!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.31,0:16:49.34,sign_9447_74_1_Week_Earlier,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(95,30)\fs18\fscy103}S\NU\NN\ND\NA\NY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:52.56,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,All right! Disguise complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.56,0:16:55.66,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Now, let's get to the bottom \Nof our little Fudo's secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:57.39,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(85,90,85,110,1,2717)\fad(507,507)\fscx100\fscy100\p1\bord0\shad0\c&H59FF6D&}m -55 11 l -52 58 49 56 49 11
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:57.39,sign_18427_212_Head_of_Secret_S,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(83,100,83,120,1,2717)\an8\fs13\fad(507,507)}Good Mesh Cap\N&\NGood Towel
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:16:59.40,main,Haru,0,0,0,,We really shouldn't stalk \Nhim like this, Misaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.40,0:17:02.20,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I really don't think he's hiding anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:05.99,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,If that's the way you feel,\N why'd you tag along?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:10.05,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I j-just want to stop you \Nfrom doing anything reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.57,0:17:12.74,main,Kids,0,0,0,,Awesome! It's Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:14.09,main,Kids,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:14.09,main,KidA,0,0,0,,It's really him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.09,0:17:15.65,main,KidB,0,0,0,,What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.65,0:17:16.45,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Patrolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:18.25,main,KidC,0,0,0,,Are you fighting Gekko?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:19.29,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.29,0:17:21.77,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,But if anything happens, \Nget to that shelter over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.77,0:17:23.92,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Just remain calm, and do not panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:24.99,main,Kids,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.99,0:17:26.48,main,Haru,0,0,0,,See? Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:29.37,main,Haru,0,0,0,,He's patrolling, just like he always does!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:33.68,main,Haru,0,0,0,,He's devoted to world peace, \Njust like I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:34.95,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Well, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.95,0:17:37.14,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I mean, he's still a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.14,0:17:38.24,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:40.56,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:42.75,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,How are there heroes here now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:45.36,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Not just Red, but Pink and Yellow...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:48.00,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Did they know we'd be here somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:49.91,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,They don't leave us a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:52.98,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Indeed. We'll have to retreat \Nfor now and regroup—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.98,0:17:55.17,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,If they know we're here, \Nwe'll just have to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:57.80,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,They don't know we're here yet, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:18:01.09,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,There you are, Desu—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:02.65,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I mean, Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.65,0:18:04.60,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You really kept me waiting, Fudo—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:05.52,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I mean, Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:07.54,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Freezing Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:08.35,italics,Changer,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:12.72,italics,Changer,0,0,0,,Change Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:17.48,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The aroma of strawberry, \Nthe flavor of justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:19.53,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Red Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:22.95,main,Kids,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.31,0:18:25.91,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Now, everyone! Get to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:27.14,sign_33889_377_smack,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(550,45,560,20)\fad(1,188)}smack
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:30.50,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,I see you tracked us down, Gelato 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.42,0:18:34.50,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Did he really just come here \Nbecause he knew they'd attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.46,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Well, didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:39.20,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Fudo-senpai isn't hiding anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:42.01,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:43.64,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Freezing Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.23,0:18:45.01,italics,Changer,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:46.48,italics,Changer,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.48,0:18:48.07,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,Yellow Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:51.03,main,Pink,0,0,0,,Pink Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:54.76,main,Pink,0,0,0,,Let's call for help from Blue and Green!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:55.99,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.49,0:18:59.61,main,Pink,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.61,0:19:01.49,main,Pink,0,0,0,,We came to back you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:02.99,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,No! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:05.08,main,Pink,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.08,0:19:07.37,main,Pink,0,0,0,,I'm a hero, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.99,0:19:15.27,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,You were totally right, Haru!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.27,0:19:17.37,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,Fudo's the guy he's always been!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.37,0:19:18.38,main,Pink,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:21.01,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,So honest and straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.01,0:19:24.01,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,Forthright and earnest in everything he does!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:25.77,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,That's our leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:28.77,sign_27955_371_Here___,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(355,130,345,110)\fad(215,1)}Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:27.17,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:28.77,sign_27955_371_Here___,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(220,285,220,265)\an8\fad(216,1)}Sounds great...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.17,0:19:28.20,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:31.02,sign_28023_374_Hero_Training_Ce,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,20)}Hero {\c&HFAE255&}Training Center
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.27,0:19:32.83,main,pink,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.83,0:19:35.62,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,You're certainly talkative \Nwhen the subject is Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:39.12,main,Pink,0,0,0,,H-Hey! I am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:05.10,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I didn't think rides would\Ngive you motion sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.78,0:20:08.43,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I didn't know either, until today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:12.23,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,There's not even that \Nmuch motion. I'm pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:15.12,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,D-Don't rock the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:17.07,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.16,0:20:23.26,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I was just thinking... getting to know \Nthese hidden sides of each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.09,0:20:26.63,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It's kind of nice, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.15,0:20:29.28,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.13,0:20:39.46,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Feeling a little better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.86,0:20:42.60,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:57.73,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,How mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:21:01.85,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,I was so uncomfortable \Non this ride until now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.53,0:21:06.44,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,But now, I hope I never \Ntouch the ground again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.62,0:21:13.31,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Look, Fudo! It seems the battle's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:14.40,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.40,0:21:16.08,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,We'd better get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:22.76,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,I think we might've crossed a line today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:25.34,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,The theme park is a fearsome place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.93,0:23:00.69,sign_33014_396_Come_feel_the_th,sign,0,0,0,,Come feel the thrill with us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.87,0:23:00.69,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,So much shopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:05.09,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I'm so glad the guys are here \Nto help me carry everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.09,0:23:06.91,main,Haru,0,0,0,,You bought way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.32,0:23:18.18,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Fudo-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.37,0:23:21.95,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Hello? Haruta-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.95,0:23:23.07,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Listen to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.07,0:23:27.42,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,My boy bought me a dinosaur keychain \Nfrom an amusement park he went to!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.42,0:23:28.42,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Honestly, that boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.42,0:23:30.56,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,He never seems to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.56,0:23:32.34,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Now, on to the main topic!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.82,0:23:37.74,italicstop,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,He says episode 4 will be called \N"Could You Please Tell Me Why?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.99,0:23:40.25,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(40,300)\fad(1005,1)}Episode 4     {\fsp5.4}Could You Please Tell Me Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.74,0:23:39.50,italicstop,Desumi,0,0,0,,Who's "Haruta-san"?
